WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.940
The things we have to do 
to get by in the human world...

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:12.850
Making sure your clothes match the season
 and current trends is such a bother.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.450
If I just had the Great Jahy's charisma,

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.710
could I also wear the 
same outfit all the time?

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:26.500
And yet, seeing her wear all kinds of 
clothes would also be a feast for the eyes.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:32.180
If only there were human fashion
that suited Her Greatness...

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.690
Wait, couldn't I just make my own brand?!

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>Thus Druj started her own apparel line.</i>

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.240
<i>Rather quickly, it became 
a huge with young women.</i>

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.070
<i>Yet the Great Jahy never picked up on it!</i>

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:04.390
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.510
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:06.720
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:07.890
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.060
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.290
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:29.540
<b>Restoration Plan No. 17

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:31.050
For our company, working with Dojima 
Corporation is like a dream come true.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.040
The feeling's mutual.

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:35.000
We're looking forward to it!

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:41.130
I wonder why there are weeks when sales flag.

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:42.870
I'll order a report on that immediately.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:48.300
Now then, we have an all-hands scheduled 
regarding next month's business expansion,

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.190
but the material for that 
hasn't arrived yet, has it?

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.010
My deepest apologies.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:56.200
We are all doing our best,

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:59.150
but it takes everything we have
just to keep up with you.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:03.330
Please don't get me wrong.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:06.330
Working under you is a joy that 
I wouldn't trade for anything.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:08.830
Working under me...

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.420
I see.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:15.330
What's next on the agenda?

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.670
Going back to the office for a board meeting.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:22.110
I want to see the Great Jahy.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:25.480
Your Greatness...

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.170
Please let me out at the next intersection.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.940
I won't be attending the meeting.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.140
But...

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.220
Do as I say.

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:36.140
U-Understood.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.770
<i>I'm just going to sneak in here!</i>

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.820
<b>Craft Pub Maou.</b>

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:47.790
Welcome!

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:49.580
Huh?

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.040
Welc—

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.880
Wait, Druj?!

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.170
What brings you by?

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.530
This is rare!

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:06.550
Why... Why is that woman here?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.010
Sh-She's our new employee.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:13.230
As you can see, we're always busy
and short on servers.

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:16.270
So we had no choice but to hire her.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.200
Oh, is that so—

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.420
It certainly is!

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:24.410
I work here now. With Jahy-kun. 
The two of us. Into the night.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.490
Together! All the time!

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:33.750
Will that be a table for one?

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.540
<i>This woman!</i>

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:43.630
<i>She's nothing but a lowly human, 
yet she dares to get close to the Great Jahy!</i>

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.220
I can't let you live another minute.

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:49.810
I'll make you regret angering me!

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.190
<i>That's right! 
This is the Great Jahy's establishment.</i>

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.970
<i>I mustn't cause any bother.</i>

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:01.860
<i>Not now.</i>

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:07.270
Yes, I am alone. Do you have a table for me?

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:10.370
We do! Seating a party of one!

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:13.470
<i>You just narrowly escaped death, little girl.</i>

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:17.600
<i>But I came here to see Her Greatness.</i>

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:19.840
<i>I don't have time to waste on a brat like y—</i>

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:24.470
I'm sorry for the wa— Aaah!

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:26.770
Please pardon me!

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:27.610
Don't worry about it.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:30.800
I'll clean this up right awa— Aaah!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.250
P-Please pardon me!

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.000
<i>What is that utterly useless creature?!</i>

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.810
<i>How could anyone hire someone so useless?!</i>

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:41.320
I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:41.320
Sheesh, what's wrong with you?

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:46.760
<i>I knew it. Her Greatness has changed 
since coming to the human world.</i>

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:48.460
<i>She's become kinder.</i>

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:53.480
<i>She's no longer... the Great Jahy 
she was in the Dark Realm.</i>

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.930
But that Her Greatness was my rock—

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.520
You absolute dunce!

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.000
How the hell do you even fall so often?

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.740
You like being on the floor that much?

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:04.120
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:07.450
If you want to become one with the floor 
so badly, go do it in the back!

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.840
You're in the way!

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.150
<i>That's it.</i>

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:16.790
<i>Her Greatness always used to scold 
her underlings like that.</i>

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.430
This takes me back...

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:21.520
The hell are you doing?

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.210
I'll take the orders.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.860
Hurry up and clean this mess already!

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:33.650
<i>That's supposed to be my place!</i>

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:36.540
<i>That little girl...</i>

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.790
The hell are you doing?!

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.990
<i>Yes... This is just how she 
was back in the Dark Realm.</i>

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.060
<i>Her Greatness would hurl elaborately 
detailed abuse at me</i>

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:49.390
<i>about how utterly useless and stupid I was.</i>

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.430
Move it.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.140
You better not spill any more.

00:06:54.650 --> 00:07:00.460
<i>Could she possibly intend to 
replace me with that girl?</i>

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.600
<i>Say it isn't so...</i>

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.610
Oh, Druj! I'll just be a few minutes.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.980
C-Certainly.

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:14.410
<i>If it's for you, Your Greatness, 
I'd wait for hours. Even eons.</i>

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.290
<i>Could it be...?</i>

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:23.210
<i>Is she chastising that girl 
in front of me on purpose?</i>

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:30.100
<i>Knowing my deepest joys and pains, 
is she doing this as the ultimate tease?!</i>

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.630
<i>I get it now.</i>

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:34.600
<i>Directly punishing me would be too easy.</i>

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.280
<i>She's ascended to the next level!</i>

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:41.060
<i>And I must follow Her Greatness there!</i>

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.300
Sorry 'bout that, Druj.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.320
What can I get you?

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:48.000
Oh, wight. I fink I will take a... uh...

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:51.490
What's wrong?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.170
You know, it doesn't matter where you are.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.450
You will always be the Great Jahy...

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.560
Where'd that come from?

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:06.380
Whenever I see you, I'm reminded 
of the Dark Realm. It's most reassuring.

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:13.130
Because you always stay yourself, 
I can always stay me, too.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.230
Even when this world is harsh,

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.790
when human society exhausts me,

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.950
when I nearly forgot about the Dark Realm...

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.310
You remain you.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:26.290
<i>I'm </i>the one who's assimilated 
more and more in the human realm.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:31.360
But because you're here, 
I'll never forget our homeland.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:36.530
I was reminded of it once again tonight!

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:42.750
That's why you hired that 
clumsy girl, too, isn't it?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.500
You're brilliant, Your Greatness!

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:48.570
Huh? Oh, uh, yeah...

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:49.670
Sure am.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.810
Thank you for the food.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:56.100
Don't think this means I've acknowledged you.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:09:00.640
Do not forget that I am 
the Great Jahy's top underling.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.140
We only accept cash.

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:16.280
I don't really get what happened, 
but it seems like it worked out.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:20.270
I really thought the jig was up this time

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:22.080
Thankfully Druj is a moron.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.410
<i>All's well that ends well.</i>

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:31.000
Waiting on the Dark Lord...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.040
Taking care of the magical girl...

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.020
Work and looking for mana crystals...

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.970
Maybe it's because so much is going on,

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.560
but no matter how much sleep 
I get, I'm still tired.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:42.080
<i>The Great Jahy is exhausted.</i>

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.070
I've gather quite a lot of mana crystals,

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.840
so I should have my powers back.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.650
Wait!

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:56.740
The futon!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.210
Is it because of this futon?!

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:03.330
How long have I been 
using this thing, anyway?

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.480
Since...

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.780
<i>Here. Use this.</i>

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:10.000
The landlord randomly brought it for me,

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.530
but there were already signs it'd been used.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.220
Now that I look at it, it's pretty grungy.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:23.430
I even wash it regularly, 
but it's yellowing more and more.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:27.330
We have a lot of mana crystals. 
The Dark Lord is back.

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.230
Work's going well.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:32.710
I've been working hard every 
day to restore the Dark Realm.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:36.190
I say I deserve something nice!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:39.640
<b>Hyper 
 Home Center</b>

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.280
That's it! I'm buying a futon!

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:41.620
Wow!

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:49.460
This one right here is a very light material 
that molds to the shape of your body.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:56.670
<b>Hard!</b>

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:56.670
<b>Light!</b>

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:56.670
<b>Heavy!</b>

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:53.250
On the flip side, there are customers who say
they prefer the secure feeling of a heavier one.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.670
For those, we recommend this right here.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:00.130
The kind you can launder at home has 
also become very popular lately.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:03.540
You get the best value by buying in a set.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:05.280
It's all kind over my head.

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.210
Would you like to lie down and try it?

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.060
Sure.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.930
<i>I mean, this is human bedding.</i>

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:17.820
<i>Compared to the blankets made from
the down of Dark Realm birds, this can't—</i>

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.080
Excuse me...

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.020
Wh-What is this?

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:26.850
I fell asleep in a second!

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:29.580
Human bedding is terrifying!

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:32.910
<i>They've got some high quality stuff, huh?</i>

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:36.070
<i>I guess what I've got at home
really is just a filthy rag.</i>

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.980
Okay, give me the best one you've got!

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:42.970
U-Understood.

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:53.270
And that's how I came to 
buy this luxury futon.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:56.360
What do you think? Nice, huh?

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:57.740
Isn't it?

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.230
So nice!

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:04.910
Nah, they probably ripped 
you off with that thing.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.150
They absolutely did not!

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:11.310
This is definitely high quality stuff!

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:13.810
Eh, it's a futon.

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:16.590
It's the perfect scam item.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.910
If you know so much, 
then why don't you try it out?!

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:22.830
Ah, fine then.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.710
So, how is it?

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:28.650
Amazing, right?

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:30.080
Huh?

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:33.640
She's asleep!

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.850
Hey! Get up!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.740
Move over!

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:45.040
I bought this with my hard-earned
 money! It's <i>my</i> blank...et...

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:53.080
Hy-chan? Ryou-chan?

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:02.700
My, my.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.300
Fast friends.

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:08.910
Oh, no! We needed to talk to Hy-chan.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:11.100
Did Ryou-chan tell her already?

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.060
What? The water's getting shut off?

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.900
That's right. Construction starts 
tomorrow and will last three days.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.860
No one told me about this!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:23.140
Yeah, my bad, but you're the one who 
started talking about your bed.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:26.400
FYI, this means no flushing the toilet either.

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:29.400
What am I supposed to do then?!

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:30.870
I want my rent money back!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.980
Just chill out.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.160
You can get by for a few days.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.520
It'll be fine.

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:37.710
You want me to go camp outside?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.280
No, no.

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.280
She's saying you can come stay with us.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.240
Go ahead and make yourself at home.

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:48.840
Ha. I'm only here because I have to be.

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:52.110
It's been forever since you stayed over.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.810
When was the last time again?

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:01.950
I think it was right after 
I came to the human world.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.310
That's right, that's right.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:08.140
Back then, you were like a 
beaten up and abandoned cat.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.650
You could've just stayed with 
us here. But you were like,

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:13.720
"I'm the Number 2 of the Dark Realm!

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:16.790
I can't live together with human scum!"

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:21.130
"Don't treat me like a child! Leave me alone!"
And all that angry yelling.

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:24.120
Good thing we had an 
open apartment at the building.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:26.800
Ja-ko's really mellowed out.

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:29.440
I didn't mellow out.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:31.920
I learned.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.180
And I grew.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:38.430
You sure have. 
I can see how much you've grown.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:44.730
With you like this, 
I should be able to give you these!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:50.080
How cute!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.740
Isn't that from when I was a kid?

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:56.670
I'm so glad I didn't throw all this away.

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.460
This one next.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:04.530
How cute!

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:07.260
That suits you!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.100
Too cute!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.480
Perfect!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.440
That's so you!

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:17.670
This, too!

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:20.910
And this one!

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.140
And this one!

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.570
What the hell?!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:31.280
What the hell do these clothes 
have to do with my growth?!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:35.120
Everything I've held on to
finally fits you perfectly.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:39.960
Wait, you're saying it's not just mental...
I've grown physically, too?

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:43.930
From now on, you should dress properly.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.920
You can have all of these.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.160
Do you even realize?

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:52.130
With my powers steadily returning,

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:57.510
I could destroy you with ease.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:03.440
You'd do well to fear and cower before me.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.460
It's fine.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:08.780
I trust you'd never do anything like that.

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:18.760
I know! We should line up our futons 
and all sleep next to each other tonight.

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:20.200
Are you serious?

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.580
<i>She trusts me?</i>

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.840
You were asleep just a little while ago.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.840
W-Well, that's 'cause...

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:32.580
<i>What would the old me have thought?</i>

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:34.800
Ah, fine.

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:46.070
Hy-chan.

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:50.650
You know, if you want, you can live 
with us for as long as you like.

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.620
There you go babying her again.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.110
I can't help it!

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:05.460
Maybe that wouldn't be too bad.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.460
Goodnight.

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:15.630
Landlord!

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:22.080
Boss...?

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.460
Nah...

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:41.720
I can't! I'm going home!

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.080
<i>Never judge a book by it's cover.</i>

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:48.730
<i>Learning that was another step 
in the Great Jahy's growth.</i>

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:24.590
<i>Damn that Jahy.</i>

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:29.540
<i>She continues to forge alliances in the 
human world and increase her power.</i>

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.900
<i>But I'm the one who's going to become
 the Dark Realm's second-in-command!</i>

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:37.160
<i>Next time, I will defeat her for sure.</i>

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:40.460
<i>To that end, I must devise a strategy.</i>

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:46.670
<i>It was yet another day where 
Saurva was plotting to defeat Jahy.</i>

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:49.020
<i>I know!</i>

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:51.130
<i>What if I kidnap someone?</i>

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.980
<i>Targeting her directly is difficult.</i>

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:58.420
<i>But it would really rattle her
if I captured one of her companions alive.</i>

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:06.140
<i>Ah, what a terrifying demon I am!</i>

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:12.520
Thank you so much for helping out.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.060
Oh, it was nothing.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:16.300
This has been bothering me.

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:18.780
There's a lot of littering around here.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:25.440
<i>I could also execute a hostage
 in front of her.</i>

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:28.200
<i>My, how diabolical my mind is!</i>

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:35.680
<i>In fact, what if I also took on 
a human underling?</i>

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:41.720
<i>Humans are easier to subjugate than demons.</i>

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.000
<i>I can use them as tools
until they're all destroyed.</i>

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:53.100
<i>Ah, how truly villainous I am!</i>

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.170
Mom!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:58.830
I'm glad we found your mom so soon.

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:00.820
Thank you so much.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.240
Thank you so, so much!

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:03.940
You're most welcome.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.190
Thank you, big sister!

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:08.520
Big... brother?

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.590
Bye-bye!

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:12.330
See you later!

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:18.690
<i>Still, that girl from the other day...
 Is she really human?</i>

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:25.170
<i>It won't be easy to find a human to face her.</i>

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:29.050
<i>I know! I should just upgrade one.</i>

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:31.560
<i>I'll turn a human into a cyborg!</i>

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:33.950
<i>My engineering skills are incredible.</i>

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:36.850
<i>Jahy's magic doesn't stand a chance.</i>

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:41.600
<i>Let me think.
 Should I include a trap directly?</i>

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:45.500
<i>Right now, I feel like I could 
make the ultimate trap.</i>

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.280
<i>What kind should I make next?</i>

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.030
<i>Maybe something using poison.</i>

00:21:55.360 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>Truly, I am evil incarnate, most worthy 
of being the Dark Realm's second-in-command.</i>

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:06.210
Thank you so much.

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:09.010
I'm scared to cross by myself.

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:11.070
Please take care.

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:17.000
<i>All day these evil thoughts 
just bubble up within me.</i>

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:20.650
<i>I'm such a bad guy!</i>

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:22.550
<i>I really am elite.</i>

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:24.610
<i>I'm special.</i>

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:26.940
That's right.

00:22:34.460 --> 00:22:36.290
You are special.

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:37.060
Huh?

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:44.410
I've seen all your good deeds, all your 
actions that show your hatred for evil.

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:47.240
Me?

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:50.190
I will grant you power.

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:14.970
In exchange, eradicate misfortune. 
Eradicate the mana crystals.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:24.000
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:24.000
<b>Saurva Will Not Lose!</b>
